  - tasks.md T159: infra/account/alerts.tf, the alarms h4-credential-audit-errors and h4-alert-bridge-failed to
    h4-alerts, missing data not breaching; infra/lambdas/alert_bridge/bridge.py and its test, which read each alarm's
    ALARM as its kind; contracts/aws-alerts.md §2's two rows, which arrive with the bridge that knows them (the bridge's
